*******************************************
*
*PMEG4030ER
*
*NXP Semiconductors
*
*MEGA Schottky barrier rectifiers
*
*
*
*
*IFSM = 50A   @ tp = 8ms
*VF   = 540mV @ IF = 3A
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*Package pinning does not match Spice model pinning.
*Package: SOD123W
*
*Package Pin 1: Cathode
*Package Pin 2: Anode            
*
*
*
*
*Simulator: SPICE2
*
*******************************************
*#
.SUBCKT PMEG4030ER 1 2
*
* The resistor R1 does not reflect 
* a physical device.  Instead it
* improves modeling in the reverse 
* mode of operation.
*
R1 1 2 4.936E+7
D1 1 2 PMEG4030ER
*
.MODEL PMEG4030ER D
+ IS = 1.656E-6
+ N = 1
+ BV = 44
+ IBV = 0.001
+ RS = 0.03034
+ CJO = 5E-10
+ VJ = 0.3122
+ M = 0.4761
+ FC = 0.5
+ EG = 0.69
+ XTI = 2
.ENDS
*

